      "stem": "Open the country growth comparison widget and pick South Korea and Argentina, starting in 1960. In 3 to 5 sentences, describe what the two paths look like and use the rule of 70 to explain how an annual growth-rate difference of just a few percentage points can produce the divergence you see by 2020. Pick concrete rates to anchor your answer.",
