      "stem": "The briefing argues that real GDP per capita is the best single measure of the material standard of living in a country. In 3 to 5 sentences, explain what each of the three words (real, GDP, per capita) contributes, and give one concrete reason the briefing offers for why total GDP alone would be misleading.",
